(5589881, 809225, 108982, '<td valign="top">Exceptional use of light.  Really meets the challenge on several levels such as dark and light representation of life and death and the young man partaking in deadly habit.  a powerful portrait, the man looks stressed and trying to regain composure.  Love this photo.</td>', 'Exceptional use of light.  Really meets the challenge on several levels such as dark and light representation of life and death and the young man partaking in deadly habit.  a powerful portrait, the man looks stressed and trying to regain composure.  Love this photo.', '2009-07-29 03:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589885, 809141, 108982, '<td valign="top">Unlike many of the plant and bug themes in the challenge this picture invokes a struggle to me where part of the leaf is alive but failing fast and rich in color and texture with the other side simply dead.</td>', 'Unlike many of the plant and bug themes in the challenge this picture invokes a struggle to me where part of the leaf is alive but failing fast and rich in color and texture with the other side simply dead.', '2009-07-29 03:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
