(5589924, 809889, 108611, '<td valign="top">alot going on in this picture for me that reflects the "life and death". first thing that caught my eye was the sun by the light pole. then the "border" of trees from (whats come into my mind) the road and then the cemetary.almost like hiding death from the life thats going on. then the fresh grave amongst the older already lain graves. the boy holding the flowers is a nice touch. almost to me another balance there of one life starting whilst one has gone in balance.</td>', 'alot going on in this picture for me that reflects the "life and death". first thing that caught my eye was the sun by the light pole. then the "border" of trees from (whats come into my mind) the road and then the cemetary.almost like hiding death from the life thats going on. then the fresh grave amongst the older already lain graves. the boy holding the flowers is a nice touch. almost to me another balance there of one life starting whilst one has gone in balance.', '2009-07-29 04:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5589929, 809822, 108611, '<td valign="top">nice take on the title. relates alot to life now days. well done</td>', 'nice take on the title. relates alot to life now days. well done', '2009-07-29 04:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
