(5590092, 810096, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice entry. I might''ve liked to see a bit more contrast but that''s it. You''ll likely get nailed for chopping off the torso but I think that adds to the photo.<br/>I''m guessing this might be a strong contender for a posthumous if this isn''t from him.</td>', 'This is a really nice entry. I might''ve liked to see a bit more contrast but that''s it. You''ll likely get nailed for chopping off the torso but I think that adds to the photo.I''m guessing this might be a strong contender for a posthumous if this isn''t from him.', '2009-07-29 08:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590093, 810006, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great contrast.  The tag makes the photo.</td>', 'Great contrast.  The tag makes the photo.', '2009-07-29 08:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590099, 809999, 56828, '<td valign="top">You can''t really see much of what is going on here.  Her hands cover up much of hte ring and I think you have too much negatve space with their bodies.  Also without a title I don''t see life and death in the photo.</td>', 'You can''t really see much of what is going on here.  Her hands cover up much of hte ring and I think you have too much negatve space with their bodies.  Also without a title I don''t see life and death in the photo.', '2009-07-29 09:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
