(5590287, 810221, 108883, '<td valign="top">Nice idea (really, I thought it was so cute, but probably not the reaction you were aiming for).  I would''ve liked to see more of the wing detail- maybe you blew out some of the detail color correcting?</td>', 'Nice idea (really, I thought it was so cute, but probably not the reaction you were aiming for).  I would''ve liked to see more of the wing detail- maybe you blew out some of the detail color correcting?', '2009-07-29 11:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
