(5590710, 809052, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like the artistic tone of this.  Much better than most of the stuff I have seen so far.  10 from me.</td>', 'I like the artistic tone of this.  Much better than most of the stuff I have seen so far.  10 from me.', '2009-07-29 16:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
