(5590772, 809225, 106806, '<td valign="top">oooooh nice .... best so far ... 11   ;-)</td>', 'oooooh nice .... best so far ... 11   ;-)', '2009-07-29 17:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590776, 810233, 99767, '<td valign="top">Wonderful B$W. Love the tone.</td>', 'Wonderful B$W. Love the tone.', '2009-07-29 17:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590779, 809954, 99767, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2009-07-29 17:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590780, 810238, 99767, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2009-07-29 17:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590781, 809809, 99767, '<td valign="top">OK this took skills. I love the creativity and it fits perfectly in this challenge.</td>', 'OK this took skills. I love the creativity and it fits perfectly in this challenge.', '2009-07-29 17:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590786, 809936, 99767, '<td valign="top">I really love where you were going with it. It would be fun to see this shot with more symetry in the flowers and a square crop.</td>', 'I really love where you were going with it. It would be fun to see this shot with more symetry in the flowers and a square crop.', '2009-07-29 17:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590787, 809225, 99767, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for well executed B&amp;W. Good work.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for well executed B&W. Good work.', '2009-07-29 17:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590788, 809946, 99767, '<td valign="top">Surreal</td>', 'Surreal', '2009-07-29 17:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590789, 809713, 103960, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of framing with the trees.  The foliage makes a lovely contrast with the dull gray of the cemetary.  I love it!</td>', 'Excellent use of framing with the trees.  The foliage makes a lovely contrast with the dull gray of the cemetary.  I love it!', '2009-07-29 17:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590790, 809888, 99767, '<td valign="top">It''s looking at me. :)</td>', 'It''s looking at me. :)', '2009-07-29 17:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590792, 809508, 99767, '<td valign="top">Funny, pollen has the exact same effect on me sometimes too.</td>', 'Funny, pollen has the exact same effect on me sometimes too.', '2009-07-29 17:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590794, 808851, 103960, '<td valign="top">My first thought when I saw this photo was "What is this a picture of"?  Maybe bright colors would have made the distinction more pronounced.  Maybe some type of frame or separation. Good subject, just doesn''t seem to get hte message across.</td>', 'My first thought when I saw this photo was "What is this a picture of"?  Maybe bright colors would have made the distinction more pronounced.  Maybe some type of frame or separation. Good subject, just doesn''t seem to get hte message across.', '2009-07-29 18:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590799, 809889, 103960, '<td valign="top">Love the dual symbolism with the sun setting at the end of a life.  With the dead trees in the background, this photo seems overwhelmed by death and leaves me feeling sorry for the little boy.  I think maybe with all the death about, the boy should stand out a bit more.  Lovely photo.</td>', 'Love the dual symbolism with the sun setting at the end of a life.  With the dead trees in the background, this photo seems overwhelmed by death and leaves me feeling sorry for the little boy.  I think maybe with all the death about, the boy should stand out a bit more.  Lovely photo.', '2009-07-29 18:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590801, 810014, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective.</td>', 'I like the perspective.', '2009-07-29 18:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590802, 809225, 103960, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2009-07-29 18:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590803, 810006, 103960, '<td valign="top">Love this photo!  It gave me goosebumps.  The tag in the ear shouts the statement loud and clear.  Thank you!</td>', 'Love this photo!  It gave me goosebumps.  The tag in the ear shouts the statement loud and clear.  Thank you!', '2009-07-29 18:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590806, 809162, 103960, '<td valign="top">I think something could be done with lighting to bring out the green of the trees.  The photo lacks a focal point and seems dark and drab.  Pull the color out and use mother nature for some natural mood lighiting!</td>', 'I think something could be done with lighting to bring out the green of the trees.  The photo lacks a focal point and seems dark and drab.  Pull the color out and use mother nature for some natural mood lighiting!', '2009-07-29 18:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590807, 809875, 103960, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  The vibrant green is a great contrast and draws the eyes right where you want them.  A simple background without trees or clouds to clutter the photo is a good choice.</td>', 'This is wonderful.  The vibrant green is a great contrast and draws the eyes right where you want them.  A simple background without trees or clouds to clutter the photo is a good choice.', '2009-07-29 18:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590808, 809888, 103960, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love it!</td>', 'Absolutely love it!', '2009-07-29 18:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590809, 810220, 103960, '<td valign="top">Love, loss, life, death.  I see them all.</td>', 'Love, loss, life, death.  I see them all.', '2009-07-29 18:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590810, 809812, 103960, '<td valign="top">Love the little peek-a-boo!  It''s like the bud is coming to life.  Though I think the bright colors are a bit overwhelming.  Few flowers would have made a bolder statement.</td>', 'Love the little peek-a-boo!  It''s like the bud is coming to life.  Though I think the bright colors are a bit overwhelming.  Few flowers would have made a bolder statement.', '2009-07-29 18:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590814, 810238, 103960, '<td valign="top">The reflections and coloring of the photo are good, but some interplay between the subjects would have given the photo a bit more interest.</td>', 'The reflections and coloring of the photo are good, but some interplay between the subjects would have given the photo a bit more interest.', '2009-07-29 18:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590815, 809159, 103960, '<td valign="top">It seems that this is the branch of death, the leaf dies from a single touch.  A little depth could improve, maybe some fading of the background to really bring attention to the focal point.  Good concept.</td>', 'It seems that this is the branch of death, the leaf dies from a single touch.  A little depth could improve, maybe some fading of the background to really bring attention to the focal point.  Good concept.', '2009-07-29 18:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590817, 809212, 103960, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I like the motion from top to bottom, left to right, front to back.  This picture moves.  Though I think the background could be blurred a bit more to really bring the subjects to the forefront.</td>', 'Great colors.  I like the motion from top to bottom, left to right, front to back.  This picture moves.  Though I think the background could be blurred a bit more to really bring the subjects to the forefront.', '2009-07-29 18:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590819, 810219, 103960, '<td valign="top">Good placement and colors.</td>', 'Good placement and colors.', '2009-07-29 18:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590820, 809189, 103960, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject, thought it kind of lacks interest.  Maybe a different setting would have helped it a bit for me.</td>', 'Excellent subject, thought it kind of lacks interest.  Maybe a different setting would have helped it a bit for me.', '2009-07-29 18:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5590948, 810220, 74979, '<td valign="top">fabulous, clever, and oh so cheerry..LOL<br/>9 from me..good  luck!</td>', 'fabulous, clever, and oh so cheerry..LOL9 from me..good  luck!', '2009-07-29 22:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
