(5591015, 809933, 59415, '<td valign="top">This really fits the challenge while freaking me out at the same time.  Mostly because I don''t want you to drop the camera.</td>', 'This really fits the challenge while freaking me out at the same time.  Mostly because I don''t want you to drop the camera.', '2009-07-29 23:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
