(5591026, 810141, 59415, '<td valign="top">I would have tweaked the horizon on this shot to level off the top lines.  Also that yellow flower should be in the frame fully including the leaves at the base.</td>', 'I would have tweaked the horizon on this shot to level off the top lines.  Also that yellow flower should be in the frame fully including the leaves at the base.', '2009-07-29 23:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
