(5591343, 809920, 67258, '<td valign="top">Unless I am being particularly thick here (and it has been known...) the answer seems rather obvious.  Don''t really get the photo in terms of the challenge, and if it weren''t for the odd title I would have thought you had intended it for the Death challenge.  In terms of artistic and technical merits of the image, it seems a snapshot of a dead mouse, nothing more.</td>', 'Unless I am being particularly thick here (and it has been known...) the answer seems rather obvious.  Don''t really get the photo in terms of the challenge, and if it weren''t for the odd title I would have thought you had intended it for the Death challenge.  In terms of artistic and technical merits of the image, it seems a snapshot of a dead mouse, nothing more.', '2009-07-30 09:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5591344, 809159, 67258, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo - and an example of how a skilled photographer with artistic vision can turn unappealing objects and subjects in to beauty.</td>', 'A beautiful photo - and an example of how a skilled photographer with artistic vision can turn unappealing objects and subjects in to beauty.', '2009-07-30 09:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
