(5591352, 809727, 107736, '<td valign="top">Not bad I guess. I didn''t like it and then I kinda did. I think the nudity part bothers me. A crop of their heads may have been a more subtle message regarding life and death. But that would be my taste and not yours.</td>', 'Not bad I guess. I didn''t like it and then I kinda did. I think the nudity part bothers me. A crop of their heads may have been a more subtle message regarding life and death. But that would be my taste and not yours.', '2009-07-30 09:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
