(5592140, 810127, 108110, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning shot, awesome sharpness, great light. Would have been better in wildlife challenge, though I logically understand the connection of the lioness to death, I don''t have that emotional response to the image at all, she looks way too gentle. 10 if it were a wildlife challenge, 7 in this one.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning shot, awesome sharpness, great light. Would have been better in wildlife challenge, though I logically understand the connection of the lioness to death, I don''t have that emotional response to the image at all, she looks way too gentle. 10 if it were a wildlife challenge, 7 in this one.', '2009-07-30 23:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592208, 809052, 36914, '<td valign="top">This almost Looks like HDR?</td>', 'This almost Looks like HDR?', '2009-07-31 00:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592267, 809933, 108774, '<td valign="top">Great - at first I thought I''d witness a traffic accident... then I saw the shoes in the foreground. Truely a life &amp; death game. The street and its painted signs show a nice geometrical pattern as well.</td>', 'Great - at first I thought I''d witness a traffic accident... then I saw the shoes in the foreground. Truely a life & death game. The street and its painted signs show a nice geometrical pattern as well.', '2009-07-31 02:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592336, 810059, 88247, '<td valign="top">This for me has to be the favourite of favourites.<br/>It''s well put together,funny but so true!<br/>Love Never Dies NO matter what!!<br/>Btw,hope they have brushed their teeth lol.<br/>Good luck:-)</td>', 'This for me has to be the favourite of favourites.It''s well put together,funny but so true!Love Never Dies NO matter what!!Btw,hope they have brushed their teeth lol.Good luck:-)', '2009-07-31 06:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592338, 810127, 88247, '<td valign="top">Aaaah,How sweet is that!<br/>Great shot well captured,I love it:-)<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Aaaah,How sweet is that!Great shot well captured,I love it:-)Good luck.', '2009-07-31 06:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592412, 810146, 57447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful location and color.</td>', 'Beautiful location and color.', '2009-07-31 09:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592418, 809492, 57447, '<td valign="top">Shot looks like a real nice abstract but with the crop I can''t really tell what it is.</td>', 'Shot looks like a real nice abstract but with the crop I can''t really tell what it is.', '2009-07-31 09:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
