(5592537, 809822, 85927, '<td valign="top">A bit to aggressive for me, but perfect for the challenge.  Usually, pictures with a gun, the gun is pointing toward the camera.  here you made ME the bad guy.  Well done</td>', 'A bit to aggressive for me, but perfect for the challenge.  Usually, pictures with a gun, the gun is pointing toward the camera.  here you made ME the bad guy.  Well done', '2009-07-31 11:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592538, 810006, 85927, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  Nice picture too</td>', 'Love the title.  Nice picture too', '2009-07-31 11:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592539, 809895, 85927, '<td valign="top">Impressive</td>', 'Impressive', '2009-07-31 11:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592540, 810127, 85927, '<td valign="top">At the first I thought "this doesn''t meet the chalenge, but with the title, it''s a perfect fit.  A great picture.  You can see the care and the love in her eye.</td>', 'At the first I thought "this doesn''t meet the chalenge, but with the title, it''s a perfect fit.  A great picture.  You can see the care and the love in her eye.', '2009-07-31 11:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592542, 810221, 85927, '<td valign="top">he he he, well done</td>', 'he he he, well done', '2009-07-31 11:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592543, 810220, 85927, '<td valign="top">Original! I like!</td>', 'Original! I like!', '2009-07-31 11:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592646, 810159, 108883, '<td valign="top">It seems like the bud in the center should be in focus, instead it''s the one alone the upper left hand corner.  I wonder if that was on purpose?</td>', 'It seems like the bud in the center should be in focus, instead it''s the one alone the upper left hand corner.  I wonder if that was on purpose?', '2009-07-31 14:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592647, 810188, 108883, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, clear, clear shot!</td>', 'Nice composition, clear, clear shot!', '2009-07-31 14:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592648, 809189, 108883, '<td valign="top">This shot is very general, I would''ve liked to see a focal.</td>', 'This shot is very general, I would''ve liked to see a focal.', '2009-07-31 14:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592650, 808842, 108883, '<td valign="top">I think a little more contrast would''ve helped this photo out.</td>', 'I think a little more contrast would''ve helped this photo out.', '2009-07-31 14:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592653, 809999, 108883, '<td valign="top">Could''ve been a little darker, or maybe had more contrast?</td>', 'Could''ve been a little darker, or maybe had more contrast?', '2009-07-31 15:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592658, 809956, 108883, '<td valign="top">Funny title...</td>', 'Funny title...', '2009-07-31 15:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592659, 809920, 108883, '<td valign="top">He''s fakin''!!!</td>', 'He''s fakin''!!!', '2009-07-31 15:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592718, 809492, 104650, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the abstract shapes. It''s a tad too small <br/>for my liking though, and I find it really hard to <br/>discern what''s in the picture. This makes it hard (for me at least) to <br/>connect the picture to the challenge topic (it''s a wine glass<br/>in a mirror on the right and something on the left, broken glass<br/>maybe?).</td>', 'I like the colors and the abstract shapes. It''s a tad too small for my liking though, and I find it really hard to discern what''s in the picture. This makes it hard (for me at least) to connect the picture to the challenge topic (it''s a wine glassin a mirror on the right and something on the left, broken glassmaybe?).', '2009-07-31 16:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592722, 809946, 104650, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The legs and shadow of the person in the back are<br/>somewhat distracting (or were they supposed to be <br/>part of the ''thing''?).</td>', 'Nice idea. The legs and shadow of the person in the back aresomewhat distracting (or were they supposed to be part of the ''thing''?).', '2009-07-31 16:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592724, 809933, 104650, '<td valign="top">I hope you just put your shoes on the ledge<br/>(it looks like it, as they seem to be untied).</td>', 'I hope you just put your shoes on the ledge(it looks like it, as they seem to be untied).', '2009-07-31 16:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592726, 810220, 104650, '<td valign="top">Funny idea, really nice execution. One of my favourites<br/>in this challenge.</td>', 'Funny idea, really nice execution. One of my favouritesin this challenge.', '2009-07-31 16:46:44.000000', NULL, 1);
