(5593094, 809727, 36808, '<td valign="top">Good concept. I like the expression on their faces.<br/>Technically, the levels seem off a bit to me (darks are to dark) and overall not as sharp as I''d like.  :)</td>', 'Good concept. I like the expression on their faces.Technically, the levels seem off a bit to me (darks are to dark) and overall not as sharp as I''d like.  :)', '2009-08-01 00:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5593124, 809141, 36808, '<td valign="top">I like how it''s sharp on the left and blurrier in the right, not to mention color and texture fades as well.  Lovely shot.</td>', 'I like how it''s sharp on the left and blurrier in the right, not to mention color and texture fades as well.  Lovely shot.', '2009-08-01 01:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
