(5595356, 809492, 52549, '<td valign="top">This looks so interesting - but too small to really judge. I wish you''d taken advantage of the 640 pixel on the longest side. Lovely colours.</td>', 'This looks so interesting - but too small to really judge. I wish you''d taken advantage of the 640 pixel on the longest side. Lovely colours.', '2009-08-02 15:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
