(5598307, 809895, 3444, '<td valign="top">Hey, This looks like Mt Olympus with point of the mountain and a little sliver of Utah Lake in the background.  Been up there many times if it is.  I might have gone a little wider to the right and left more room at the top.  Kudos for the day hike.</td>', 'Hey, This looks like Mt Olympus with point of the mountain and a little sliver of Utah Lake in the background.  Been up there many times if it is.  I might have gone a little wider to the right and left more room at the top.  Kudos for the day hike.', '2009-08-04 11:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5598483, 809492, 67258, '<td valign="top">The small size of this photo will be damaging it''s score - it really is hard to make the detail out.  No vote.</td>', 'The small size of this photo will be damaging it''s score - it really is hard to make the detail out.  No vote.', '2009-08-04 15:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5598489, 810070, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation of the challenge.  Gritty image of a subject uncomfortable to Western eyes.  A strong photo. Back to bump - in my top 3 of this challenge.</td>', 'Good interpretation of the challenge.  Gritty image of a subject uncomfortable to Western eyes.  A strong photo. Back to bump - in my top 3 of this challenge.', '2009-08-04 15:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5598491, 809508, 67258, '<td valign="top">Love the vivid colours - the scattering of yellow pollen around the dead fly is a good touch.</td>', 'Love the vivid colours - the scattering of yellow pollen around the dead fly is a good touch.', '2009-08-04 15:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5598492, 809933, 67258, '<td valign="top">I really don''t think I want to know what risks you took to get this photo.  An interesting interpretation, and a good choice of location.</td>', 'I really don''t think I want to know what risks you took to get this photo.  An interesting interpretation, and a good choice of location.', '2009-08-04 15:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5598494, 810219, 67258, '<td valign="top">From the challenge perspective, I feel this entry would fare better in the Death challenge - personally I don''t get much of a sence of Life &amp; Death.  That aside, it is a good photo with a superb rendering of texture.</td>', 'From the challenge perspective, I feel this entry would fare better in the Death challenge - personally I don''t get much of a sence of Life & Death.  That aside, it is a good photo with a superb rendering of texture.', '2009-08-04 15:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5598495, 810030, 67258, '<td valign="top">A sound idea for an entry.  The raven (or jackdaw?) doesn''t stand out very well from the background, and the image as a whole does look a touch under-exposed.</td>', 'A sound idea for an entry.  The raven (or jackdaw?) doesn''t stand out very well from the background, and the image as a whole does look a touch under-exposed.', '2009-08-04 15:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5598552, 809404, 108642, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but I wish the DOF was bigger.</td>', 'Good shot, but I wish the DOF was bigger.', '2009-08-04 16:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
