(5598571, 810113, 108642, '<td valign="top">There are a bunch pictures of live vs. dead flowers in this challenge, but this one made me stop and say "Wow, that is interesting."  Good shot.</td>', 'There are a bunch pictures of live vs. dead flowers in this challenge, but this one made me stop and say "Wow, that is interesting."  Good shot.', '2009-08-04 16:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
