(5599206, 809822, 108525, '<td valign="top">This was my first challenge, but I wasn''t expecting to place so low.  I dont think a lot of people realized the "grain" was deliberate to give the picture a harsher mood.  <br/>I started out shooting at an ISO 200 and then switched to 1600 and fell in love with the noise in the shot.<br/>OH Well.... there''s always the next challenge.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-05 01:50:54.</i></td>', 'This was my first challenge, but I wasn''t expecting to place so low.  I dont think a lot of people realized the "grain" was deliberate to give the picture a harsher mood.  I started out shooting at an ISO 200 and then switched to 1600 and fell in love with the noise in the shot.OH Well.... there''s always the next challenge.  ', '2009-08-05 01:07:04.000000', '2009-08-05 02:50:54.000000', 0),
