(5599348, 809677, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ouch. Too bad about the DQ, but it''s happened to many of us. Thanks for the notes about what was going on. I was pretty sure there was something about it I didn''t understand. A good concept and very different from all the dead flowers in this challenge. It just didn''t carry across to the voters. Feel welcome to whack me with a cluebat.</td>', 'Ouch. Too bad about the DQ, but it''s happened to many of us. Thanks for the notes about what was going on. I was pretty sure there was something about it I didn''t understand. A good concept and very different from all the dead flowers in this challenge. It just didn''t carry across to the voters. Feel welcome to whack me with a cluebat.', '2009-08-05 01:50:46.000000', NULL, 0),
