(5599442, 809895, 99767, '<td valign="top">I ended up with a higher score than I thought I would. Overall I''m pretty happy with the results of my first challenge submission. If I had to do it again I think I would have tried to frame the shot without the smaller rock. I also would have got really wide and tried to emphasis how high up we were. Thanks everyone for all the feedback. I''m a beginner at this so I really value the input and perspective a community like this can provide.</td>', 'I ended up with a higher score than I thought I would. Overall I''m pretty happy with the results of my first challenge submission. If I had to do it again I think I would have tried to frame the shot without the smaller rock. I also would have got really wide and tried to emphasis how high up we were. Thanks everyone for all the feedback. I''m a beginner at this so I really value the input and perspective a community like this can provide.', '2009-08-05 02:32:44.000000', NULL, 0),
