(5599597, 809052, 94949, '<td valign="top">Thanks everybody!<br/> <br/>It was so much fun creating this one.  I got a little help from user HEIDAHB with the props and she was the on-site manager :-)  <br/> <br/>The scene is lit from a 430EX with a silver umbrella camera left and a Vivitar flash with silver umbrella, (borrowed from user OFFIOF) camera right, and of course my 580EX that my favorite model Rósa is hiding with her hair.  <br/> <br/>My only regret here is that the 580 should have ben just a tad lower to avoid the burn in Rósa''s hair and on the arms, but hey, it´s a blue so no worries :-)<br/> <br/>Thanks again heidahb, offiof, Rósa and her sister Ella which took care of costumes and makeup :-)and of course everybody that gave me a 10!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-05 04:51:57.</i></td>', 'Thanks everybody! It was so much fun creating this one.  I got a little help from user HEIDAHB with the props and she was the on-site manager :-)   The scene is lit from a 430EX with a silver umbrella camera left and a Vivitar flash with silver umbrella, (borrowed from user OFFIOF) camera right, and of course my 580EX that my favorite model Rósa is hiding with her hair.   My only regret here is that the 580 should have ben just a tad lower to avoid the burn in Rósa''s hair and on the arms, but hey, it´s a blue so no worries :-) Thanks again heidahb, offiof, Rósa and her sister Ella which took care of costumes and makeup :-)and of course everybody that gave me a 10!!', '2009-08-05 05:36:48.000000', '2009-08-05 05:51:57.000000', 0),
