(5599654, 809227, 20927, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> A very neat looking tree and it contrasts nicely with the somber graveyard. Seems cropped just a touch too tight for my preference. It''s just not all coming together for me though, and I have to give it a neutral 5. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Nop, no cropp''s it''s an original photo - just some colors are tweaked :)<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: A very neat looking tree and it contrasts nicely with the somber graveyard. Seems cropped just a touch too tight for my preference. It''s just not all coming together for me though, and I have to give it a neutral 5.   Nop, no cropp''s it''s an original photo - just some colors are tweaked :)', '2009-08-05 06:56:52.000000', NULL, 0),
