(5599997, 809933, 2764, '<td valign="top">remind me not to loan you my lens.  This picture is really startling.  I captures the vertigo feeling of height and the lure of the fall in a way that makes it uncomfortable even to look at.  I guess the moving cars, the curves, and the directional arrows contribute to the sense of spin and dizziness.</td>', 'remind me not to loan you my lens.  This picture is really startling.  I captures the vertigo feeling of height and the lure of the fall in a way that makes it uncomfortable even to look at.  I guess the moving cars, the curves, and the directional arrows contribute to the sense of spin and dizziness.', '2009-08-05 11:51:56.000000', NULL, 0),
