(5602724, 810106, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m stoked, the "bug" has bitten. Thx all who voted (except the evil masked "1" voter), and those who commented, Katherine, Jason (yes you are correct, I have two types of Shrike on my plot (Fiscal and Crimson Breasted Shrike)) but I''ve only seen them impale Lizards so it never dawned on me, and how the Shrike avoids those spikes is anyone''s guess!, Juliet for advice on colours, will try harder next time in PS but I am still "old school" and find Post Processing cheating!, Dan thx for encouragement I was rather lucky!</td>', 'Wow, I''m stoked, the "bug" has bitten. Thx all who voted (except the evil masked "1" voter), and those who commented, Katherine, Jason (yes you are correct, I have two types of Shrike on my plot (Fiscal and Crimson Breasted Shrike)) but I''ve only seen them impale Lizards so it never dawned on me, and how the Shrike avoids those spikes is anyone''s guess!, Juliet for advice on colours, will try harder next time in PS but I am still "old school" and find Post Processing cheating!, Dan thx for encouragement I was rather lucky!', '2009-08-07 13:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
