(5604109, 810106, 87808, '<td valign="top">Here is a little more of what i was talking about, working with a smaller JPG hurts, but you can get teh general ideas as to what i mean with selective colours and hue and saturation. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=812526" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/87808/120/812526.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/87808/120/812526.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/87808/120/812526.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I should also add, it is very grainy from doing a close crop and over processed some what, but it is a general idea<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-08 12:43:20.</i></td>', 'Here is a little more of what i was talking about, working with a smaller JPG hurts, but you can get teh general ideas as to what i mean with selective colours and hue and saturation.    I should also add, it is very grainy from doing a close crop and over processed some what, but it is a general idea', '2009-08-08 13:42:13.000000', '2009-08-08 13:43:20.000000', 0),
